p of revolution which affects the doctor's career, his family, and his love to Lara.</p>","updated":1704793450,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/27627"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1155773","name":"Part 3"}}}}]
